; Input-alias-safe mutating add: BOTH inputs and the output share one
; layout (the match precondition), so the second input may alias the
; mutated storage — element i coincides everywhere by construction. The
; Rust op declares the matching may-share permit.
(constructor LayoutTensorOpAddMutatingInputAliasSafeGeneric (LayoutTensor LayoutTensor) LayoutTensorOp)
